      "writtenOn": "2026-08-24T00:09:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As a note, I\u0027m open to arguments justifying breaking `libpldm([+]+)?` API/ABI in order to fix (entangled?) design deficiencies.",
      "parentUuid": "96544629_12ef7497",
      "revId": "24adc64c379c3bb9110a9380ef7994520044a192",
